<title>MEXICO: Parras posts Q1 oper loss, net rises.</title>
<headline>Parras posts Q1 oper loss, net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997	     Q1 1996</p>
<p>Oper loss	  12.51 million Oper gain 48.90 million</p>
<p>Net		  773,000		  57.30  million</p>
<p>Revs		 184.81 million	 348.95 million</p>
<p>Integ fin cost   428,000	gain    23.54  million</p>
<p>All figures in Mexican pesos. The company</p>
<p>reported extraordinary losses.</p>
<p>Full company name is Compania Industrial de Parras,</p>
<p>S.A. de C.V.</p>
<p>( (-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
</text>
